{"title":"빙의검신","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=nEKA5/hAC1LPJ3Tf/JOULp8MUMeVHCaWXiaGIY0&filename=th3","synopsis":"7급 공무원이었던 내가 대제갈세가의 망나니 대공자가 됐다고?!\n\n죽기 아니면 까무러치기로\n스펙을 쌓아 얻은 7급 공무원 생활,\n여유를 즐길 주말만 기다리던 내게……\n\n-백리진이오\n\n내게 찾아온 《영웅로》의 주인공, 백리진\n아니, 정신을 차려 보니 내가 소설 속에 있었다\n어릴 적 가문의 과분한 투자와 사랑을 받았으나\n이제는 질풍노도의 시기를 겪는 망나니,\n눈 뜨고 주인공에게 기연을 빼앗기는 엑스트라……\n그리고 십 년 후, 혈마교에 멸문당할 제갈세가의 대공자로!\n\n지옥 같은 입시 경쟁을 뚫고 나온 프로 노력러,\n이제 무림을 준동시킨다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":154,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":149,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":184,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":191,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":181,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":183,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":161,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":191,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":174,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":146,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":269,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":163,"change":{"type":"up","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":165,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":125,"c